{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context / immutable basis\nAt origin/main@d6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84, exactly 53 editable prose blocks exist across 8 declared paths. Base spans below are immutable citations, not edit coordinates. Condense only these blocks; executable behavior and all unlisted prose stay fixed.\n\n## Exact allowlist — 53 blocks\n- src/rebar/grounding/deps.py (8): module docstring 1-38; normalize_name docstring 184-194 and PEP-503 comment 198-200; stdlib-abstain comment 234-237; _http_get docstring 304-310; _probe_registry docstring 320-328; refute_package docstring 430-444; enumerate_dependencies docstring 514-527.\n- src/rebar/grounding/detectors/builtin/security_iac_public_exposure.yaml (1): leading comment 1-21.\n- src/rebar/grounding/detectors/builtin/security_secrets_gitleaks.yaml (1): leading comment 1-12.\n- src/rebar/grounding/detectors/builtin/smell_conflict_markers.yaml (1): leading comment 1-26.\n- src/rebar/grounding/engine_b.py (10): module docstring 1-30; comments 75-77, 142-147, 216-219, and 282-286; docstrings astgrep_binary 93-97, ScanResult 109-114, _resolve_astgrep_sgconfig 153-161, _is_applicable 208-214, and scan 308-316.\n- src/rebar/grounding/oracle.py (10): module docstring 1-37; vocabulary comment 57-73; refute_absence docstring 107-124 and fail-open comment 125-128; _maybe_escalate_t2 docstring 158-167; applies docstring 194-208 and registry-routing comment 222-224; scan 272-288, contract 323-330, and _backend_availability 344-349 docstrings.\n- src/rebar/grounding/resolve.py (20): module docstring 1-37; comments 66-70, 344-346, 466-468, 472-475, 545-547, 594-598, and 632-637; docstrings validate_reference 86-97, CtagsIndex 130-136, _language